Telemost tunnel mode
====================

This feature bundles and adapts code from whitelist-bypass:

    https://github.com/kulikov0/whitelist-bypass

- The relay binary (`librelay.so`, packaged under android/app/src/main/jniLibs)
  is built from the project's `relay/` Go package and runs in
  `telemost-headless-joiner` mode.
- The Android process controller
  (android/app/src/main/kotlin/com/hiddify/hiddify/TelemostRelayController.kt)
  is adapted from the project's HeadlessRelayController.

